{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fast-paced action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/c0429db278893d948399107c735e3f5e.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/c0429db278893d948399107c735e3f5e.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a high-energy game that requires rapid movement, frenetic combat, and immediate decision-making. In this dynamic environment, you will have to adapt quickly to changes and emerging threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A soul shared by 4 characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/d6d24feeebc9e7850e1e4e7f116fda03.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/d6d24feeebc9e7850e1e4e7f116fda03.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul is shared by four characters with different abilities and characteristics. Switch characters at any time and unleash combos and synergies against your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A World in Transformation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/11cc264e42307690306e8aa88742ab0a.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/11cc264e42307690306e8aa88742ab0a.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/11cc264e42307690306e8aa88742ab0a.mp4?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bononia depicts a world disfigured by nightmares and is in constant transformation. By facing nightmares and evil spirits you can change its fortunes or plunge into an even worse nightmare. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customizing Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/81829e73ede1f2a6655861f681cf5b2b.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/81829e73ede1f2a6655861f681cf5b2b.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/81829e73ede1f2a6655861f681cf5b2b.mp4?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously collect, upgrade and refine your powers. Discard those that no longer serve your path and experiment with new ways of dealing with the many threats. Magic flows through your veins and you will tap into every drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person frenetic action: Master the frenetic movement mechanics to run and jump through enemies with evasive maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in procedural dungeons: Beneath the city lies a huge network of dungeons and catacombs. Measure yourself against these dangers to become stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own build with each run: unlock effigies and upgrade with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biomes with different creatures and bosses: nightmares take many different forms, face yours.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2843680?t=1772527193","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/5c5fda0778ebd5fe9285be60f4b1d7842b40b369/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772527193","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/bcf3ab77d4c63c8aeca9538b63778b639c963536/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772527193","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/bcf3ab77d4c63c8aeca9538b63778b639c963536/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772527193","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3528520,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Fast-paced action</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/c0429db278893d948399107c735e3f5e.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/c0429db278893d948399107c735e3f5e.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in a high-energy game that requires rapid movement, frenetic combat, and immediate decision-making. In this dynamic environment, you will have to adapt quickly to changes and emerging threats.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A soul shared by 4 characters</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/d6d24feeebc9e7850e1e4e7f116fda03.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/d6d24feeebc9e7850e1e4e7f116fda03.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your soul is shared by four characters with different abilities and characteristics. Switch characters at any time and unleash combos and synergies against your enemies.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">A World in Transformation</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/11cc264e42307690306e8aa88742ab0a.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/11cc264e42307690306e8aa88742ab0a.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/11cc264e42307690306e8aa88742ab0a.mp4?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bononia depicts a world disfigured by nightmares and is in constant transformation. By facing nightmares and evil spirits you can change its fortunes or plunge into an even worse nightmare. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Customizing Powers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/81829e73ede1f2a6655861f681cf5b2b.poster.avif?t=1772527193\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/81829e73ede1f2a6655861f681cf5b2b.webm?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/extras/81829e73ede1f2a6655861f681cf5b2b.mp4?t=1772527193\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continuously collect, upgrade and refine your powers. Discard those that no longer serve your path and experiment with new ways of dealing with the many threats. Magic flows through your veins and you will tap into every drop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person frenetic action: Master the frenetic movement mechanics to run and jump through enemies with evasive maneuvers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survival in procedural dungeons: Beneath the city lies a huge network of dungeons and catacombs. Measure yourself against these dangers to become stronger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create your own build with each run: unlock effigies and upgrade with each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 biomes with different creatures and bosses: nightmares take many different forms, face yours.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Power Up Team"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2843680/3f61c9f3e8